cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "External Validation of EchoNext-Mini in MIMIC-IV"
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Otabor
    given-names: Emmanuel
version: 2.0.2
license: MIT
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.20962994
    description: Concept DOI, always resolves to the latest version
abstract: >-
  Independent external validation, recalibration and prioritisation analysis of the publicly
  released EchoNext-Mini electrocardiographic model for structural heart disease, applied frozen to
  MIMIC-IV and to the released EchoNext-Mini benchmark test set. Includes BigQuery label and cohort
  definitions, a Waveform Database to model inference adapter, an implementation equivalence test
  against the released module, and the full analysis pipeline.
keywords:
  - electrocardiography
  - structural heart disease
  - external validation
  - calibration
  - MIMIC-IV
  - deep learning
